<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" agent="Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/146.0.0.0 Safari/537.36" version="29.6.1">
  <diagram name="Page-1" id="3LRXLGhcx1EXiKR1UMEr">
    <mxGraphModel dx="2741" dy="834" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1169" pageHeight="1654" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="4xkRWm7KM3-KMa46Uwpj-2" parent="1" style="shape=image;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=default;verticalAlign=top;aspect=fixed;imageAspect=0;image=data:image/png,;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="327" width="1667" x="92" y="629.0033435058593" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="UnI0fS5W2R1EIqpq5tZH-1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-weight: 400; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;Immune system control is a principal hurdle in cancer evolution.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 20px; background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(18, 18, 18)); color: light-dark(rgb(34, 34, 34), rgb(208, 208, 208)); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 20px; background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(18, 18, 18)); color: light-dark(rgb(34, 34, 34), rgb(208, 208, 208)); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif;&quot;&gt;temporal dynamics of immune evasion remain incompletely characterized&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 20px; background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(18, 18, 18)); color: light-dark(rgb(34, 34, 34), rgb(208, 208, 208)); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;, and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 20px; background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(18, 18, 18)); color: light-dark(rgb(34, 34, 34), rgb(208, 208, 208)); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif;&quot;&gt; how immune-mediated selection interrelates with epigenome alteration&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 20px; background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(18, 18, 18)); color: light-dark(rgb(34, 34, 34), rgb(208, 208, 208)); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; is unclear.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 20px; background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(18, 18, 18)); color: light-dark(rgb(34, 34, 34), rgb(208, 208, 208)); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Here we infer the genome- and epigenome-driven evolutionary dynamics of tumor-immune coevolution within primary colorectal cancers (CRCs). We utilize a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 20px; background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(18, 18, 18)); color: light-dark(rgb(34, 34, 34), rgb(208, 208, 208)); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif;&quot;&gt;multiregion multiomic dataset of matched genome, transcriptome and chromatin accessibility profiling from 495 single glands (from 29 CRCs) supplemented with high-resolution spatially resolved neoantigen sequencing data and multiplexed imaging of the tumor microenvironment from 82 microbiopsies within 11 CRCs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 20px; background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(18, 18, 18)); color: light-dark(rgb(34, 34, 34), rgb(208, 208, 208)); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 20px; background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(18, 18, 18)); color: light-dark(rgb(34, 34, 34), rgb(208, 208, 208)); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif;&quot;&gt;Somatic chromatin accessibility&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 20px; background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(18, 18, 18)); color: light-dark(rgb(34, 34, 34), rgb(208, 208, 208)); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; alterations contribute to accessibility loss of antigen-presenting genes and silencing of neoantigens. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 20px; background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(18, 18, 18)); color: light-dark(rgb(34, 34, 34), rgb(208, 208, 208)); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif;&quot;&gt;Immune escape and exclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 20px; background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(18, 18, 18)); color: light-dark(rgb(34, 34, 34), rgb(208, 208, 208)); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; occur at the outset of CRC formation, and later intratumoral differences in immuno-editing are negligible or exclusive to sites of invasion.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 20px; background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(18, 18, 18)); color: light-dark(rgb(34, 34, 34), rgb(208, 208, 208)); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Collectively, immune evasion in CRC follows a ‘&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 20px; background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(18, 18, 18)); color: light-dark(rgb(34, 34, 34), rgb(208, 208, 208)); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif;&quot;&gt;Big Bang&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 20px; background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(18, 18, 18)); color: light-dark(rgb(34, 34, 34), rgb(208, 208, 208)); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;’ evolutionary pattern, whereby it is acquired close to transformation and defines subsequent cancer-immune evolution.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="522" width="746" x="88" y="95" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="UnI0fS5W2R1EIqpq5tZH-2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" value="&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nature.com/articles/s41588-025-02349-1&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;h1 class=&quot;c-article-title&quot; data-test=&quot;article-title&quot; data-article-title=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 1.875rem; margin: 0px 0px 16px; font-weight: 700; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; letter-spacing: min(max(-0.0117156rem, 4vw), -0.0390625rem); line-height: 1.2; box-sizing: inherit; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nature.com/articles/s41588-025-02349-1&quot;&gt;Epigenetically driven and early immune evasion in colorectal cancer evolution&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nature.com/articles/s41588-025-02349-1&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/a&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="74" width="969" x="82" y="21" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="UnI0fS5W2R1EIqpq5tZH-4" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;table&gt;&lt;thead&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;Feature&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;MMR-deficient (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;mismatch repair&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;) CRC&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;MMR-proficient (MMRp) CRC&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/thead&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;Frequency&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;~15% of CRC&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;~85% of CRC&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;Mutation burden&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;High&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;Low&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;Neoantigen load&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;High&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;Lower (but present)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;Immune infiltration&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Strong&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;Variable but prognostic&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;ICB response&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;Generally good,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;~30% non-responders&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;Largely ineffective,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="352" width="747" x="914" y="170" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;high-depth panel sequencing (PS) and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;cyclic immunofluorescence&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16.6667px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 20px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;(CyCIF) imaging&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" link="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt;high-depth panel sequencing (PS) and cyclic immunofluorescence&lt;/span&gt;&lt;sup style=&quot;vertical-align: baseline; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 0; position: relative; top: -0.5em; box-sizing: inherit; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;a data-track=&quot;click&quot; data-track-action=&quot;reference anchor&quot; data-track-label=&quot;link&quot; data-test=&quot;citation-ref&quot; aria-label=&quot;Reference 24&quot; title=&quot;Lin, J.-R. et al. Highly multiplexed immunofluorescence imaging of human tissues and tumors using t-CyCIF and conventional optical microscopes. eLife 7, e31657 (2018).&quot; href=&quot;https://www.nature.com/articles/s41588-025-02349-1#ref-CR24&quot; id=&quot;ref-link-section-d22200984e964&quot; style=&quot;vertical-align: baseline; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 102, 153); overflow-wrap: break-word; text-decoration: underline 0.0625rem; text-decoration-skip-ink: auto; text-underline-offset: 0.08em; word-break: break-word; box-sizing: inherit;&quot;&gt;24&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;(CyCIF) imaging&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" id="UnI0fS5W2R1EIqpq5tZH-5">
          <mxCell parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry height="65" width="383.78" x="1375.22" y="939" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="UnI0fS5W2R1EIqpq5tZH-6" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;small regions representing superficial tumor, invasive margin and lymph node deposits&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-size: 18px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;n&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;= 82&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="118" width="219" x="1144" y="568" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="UnI0fS5W2R1EIqpq5tZH-8" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;In total, we assembled sequencing data from a total of 495 FF and 82 FFPE biopsies from 29 patients (median of 15 FF and eight FFPE biopsies per patient) with concurrent CyCIF analysis of eight patients.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="87" width="870" x="219" y="956" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="UnI0fS5W2R1EIqpq5tZH-9" parent="1" style="shape=image;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=default;verticalAlign=top;aspect=fixed;imageAspect=0;image=data:image/png,;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="776" width="1532.67" x="260" y="1109" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="UnI0fS5W2R1EIqpq5tZH-12" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;Mutation burden: MMRd &amp;gt;&amp;gt; MMRp&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Fraction of mutations that produce neoantigens: MMRd &amp;lt; MMRp&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Genetic immune escape mechanisms (HLA / antigen)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;- HLA SNV / frameshift / LOH&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;- APGs (antigen-presenting genes)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Non-genetic (adaptive) immune escape&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;- PD-L1 / CTLA-4 expression&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="393" width="300" x="-72" y="1417" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="UnI0fS5W2R1EIqpq5tZH-15" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt;all FF–WGS samples&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="44" width="182" x="638" y="1072.003251953125" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="UnI0fS5W2R1EIqpq5tZH-17" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&#xa;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt;all FFPE–PS&lt;/span&gt;&#xa;&#xa;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="227" x="1445" y="1082" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="UnI0fS5W2R1EIqpq5tZH-18" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;Immune dN/dS : Ratio of nonsynonymous / synonymous mutations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;In MHC-presented peptides → Immune selection on tumor mutations&lt;br&gt;Are tumor cells shaped by immune pressure?&lt;br&gt;~1 → Neutral (no immune selection)&lt;br&gt;&amp;lt;1 → Negative selection (immune removes antigenic mutations)&lt;br&gt;&amp;gt;1 → Positive selection (tumor escapes immune pressure)&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="230" width="370" x="-76" y="1150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
